uavlink (0.1.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * uavlink --version, the setup page and the saved apply record show the
    package version again (0.1.1 still reported 0.1.0).
  * Tests: the version in the code and the manual page must match this
    changelog; the integration tests read it from here.

