uavlink (0.1.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * First PPA release.
  * Pre-check: X25 health snapshot (sensors, GPS, battery, EKF, pre-arm) and
    network path checks (X25 over LAN, CM5 <-> VPS both ways, GCS ports).
  * Fixes from the first real apply and uninstall in a container: rollback
    no longer auto-confirmed under sudo over SSH, group membership recorded
    in the manifest, unattended-upgrades kept on uninstall, and more.
  * X25: works with pymavlink TCP/UDP addresses, firmware without host IP
    parameters, step failures reported after a reboot.
  * CLI: warnings shown as warnings, translated step and stage names.
  * Formal Vietnamese/English texts on the setup page.

 -- tomphan <phanthaitrung@gmail.com>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:30:00 +0700

